{"id": "71696", "title": "特种兵之血刃传说", "author": "三棱军刺", "category": "肉文辣文", "count": 13, "available": 0, "cover": "", "status": "连载中", "source": "files/article/info/71/71696.htm", "intro": "兵之刃，必染血！\n    杨成，一个普通少年，为寻父从军，以不屈之志，铸不朽传奇！\n    新兵营中，勇夺桂冠；军演场上，绝境逆转；猎人学校，浴血奋战；兵王大赛，谁人可拦？\n    他的心中，有一个信念：\n    军人尊严，不容亵渎！犯我中华者，虽远必诛！", "base": "files/article/html/71/71696", "chapters": [{"title": "正文", "volume": true}, {"title": "第1章 怕不怕死", "file": "11249923.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第2章 训练到晕", "file": "11249924.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第3章 激烈搏斗", "file": "11249925.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第4章 父亲失踪", "file": "11249926.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第5章 三月之约", "file": "11249927.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第6章 入伍宣誓", "file": "11249928.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第7章 热血训话", "file": "11249929.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第8章 突发任务", "file": "11249930.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第9章 内讧", "file": "11249931.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第10章 有惊无险", "file": "11249932.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第11章 首战失利", "file": "11249933.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第12章 误伤", "file": "11252479.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第13章 援手到来", "file": "11252480.html", "available": false}]}